        "DKS-XD-012"
      ],
      "ui_surface": "UNB-UI-S-003",
      "notes": "Widget and API submissions use the same command and the same affirmation check (UNB-RCN-GRT-010). Supporting-org grants capture the donor/advisor donor-control certification here when the grantee certification is absent (UNB-RCN-REG-002). Pledge question shown per sponsor policy (RCD-016: default NoticeConditions)."
    },
