  "invariants": [
    "A recommendation never moves money and never reserves capacity",
    "Every submission carries AffirmationEvidence for the current disclosure version with an explicit affirmative action; no pre-checked or inferred consent",
    "A recommendation binds to a canonical charity identity, never free text",
    "Under pledge policy NoticeConditions no pledge identifier leaves the platform in sponsor-issued artifacts; inbound pledge references are internal evidence only",
    "Withdrawal is possible only before the sponsor decision; withdrawal and grant closure commit together"
  ]
